# ==============================================================================
# Apka Bill (Orion POS) — Workspace Environment Template (Internal & External)
# ==============================================================================
# Env Files Layout:
#   Backend Local (Postgres + Storage + Auth): backend/.env           (template: backend/.env.example)
#   Frontend Local Dev (Internal :8080):       frontend/.env.development.local
#   Frontend Production / APK (External API):  frontend/.env.production
#
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# RUN COMMANDS (run from /Users/ayush/Code/ApkaBill/orion-pulse)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ONE COMMAND (Postgres + Backend :8080 + Frontend :8081):
#   npm run dev
#
# Built Backend Start (auto-starts local Postgres too):
#   npm start
#
# Extra / Individual Commands:
#   Push Schema / Drizzle UI:       cd backend && npx drizzle-kit push && npx drizzle-kit studio
#   Full Build:                     npm run build
#   Capacitor Android Sync:         cd frontend && npm run cap:sync
#   Capacitor Local Emulator:       cd frontend && VITE_API_URL=http://10.0.2.2:8080 npm run cap:sync
#   Android Debug APK:              cd frontend/android && JAVA_HOME="/opt/homebrew/opt/openjdk@21/libexec/openjdk.jdk/Contents/Home" ./gradlew assembleDebug --no-daemon
#
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DEV LOGIN CREDENTIALS (Local Dev / Seeded DB)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Org Admin ID (Email):  admin@orion.com
# Org Admin Password:    admin123
# Super Admin IDs:       superadmin@apkabill.com  (or superadmin@orion.com / superadmin)
# Super Admin Password:  SuperAdmin@123           (active in dev when SUPER_ADMIN_PASSWORD unset)
#
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# POSTGRESQL & STORAGE (INTERNAL vs EXTERNAL)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PostgreSQL (Internal Local):    DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:postgres@localhost:5432/orion
# PostgreSQL (External Neon DB):  DATABASE_URL=postgresql://USER:PASSWORD@HOST/DB?sslmode=require
# Media Storage (Internal):       Leave CLOUDINARY_* empty -> backend saves to backend/uploads/products & invoices
# Media Storage (External):       Set CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME / API_KEY / API_SECRET (required for Cloudflare Workers)
# Client Offline Storage:         Browser Web & Capacitor use local IndexedDB + localStorage (no env needed)
#
# Frontend API Targets:
#   Internal (Localhost):         VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8080
#   Internal (Android Emulator):  VITE_API_URL=http://10.0.2.2:8080
#   External (Workers API):       VITE_API_URL=https://orion-pos-api.ayushpalworkplace2006.workers.dev

# Backend Core / Database (PostgreSQL)
PORT=8080
NODE_ENV=development
DB_TYPE=postgres
DATABASE_PROVIDER=postgres
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:postgres@localhost:5432/orion
BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080

# Backend Media Storage (Empty = Local Disk backend/uploads/* ; Set for External Cloudinary)
CLOUDINARY_URL=
CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=
CLOUDINARY_API_KEY=
CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET=

# Google Workspace OAuth 2.0 Environment Configuration
GOOGLE_OAUTH_ENABLED=true
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-google-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=your-google-client-secret
GOOGLE_REDIRECT_URI=http://localhost:8080/api/google/callback
GOOGLE_TOKEN_ENCRYPTION_KEY=your-secure-32-byte-hex-or-phrase
